  m_text: "A prefab can hold instances of other prefabs: these are nested prefabs. The Bus Stop prefab holds two Bench instances and a shelter. A change to the Bench prefab reaches the benches inside every Bus Stop too.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> You make the Bench prefab's legs taller. What happens to the benches inside the Bus Stop?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Open the Bus Stop prefab and find the two Bench instances in its Hierarchy.\n2. Open Bench, change the legs, and go back.\n3. Look at the Bus Stop in the scene.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: 4 \xB7 Prefab and instance (this scene)</color></size>"
