      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "A prefab variant is a prefab built on another one. It inherits everything from its base prefab and keeps its own overrides. Bench - Long is a variant of Bench. Material Variants, taught in Materials, follow the same idea for materials.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> You give the Bench prefab steel legs. Does Bench - Long, its variant, get steel legs too?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Right-click Bench in the Prefabs folder \u203A Create \u203A Prefab Variant.\n2. Open the new variant and change one value.\n3. Change the same value in Bench and see which one wins.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Materials topic, Materials-Training 2 \xB7 Material Variants</color></size>"
