  m_text: 'When an asset is deleted, the objects that pointed to it keep an empty reference, shown as Missing. A mesh whose material is missing is drawn magenta. A component whose script is missing stays on the object but does nothing.


    <b>Predict:</b> The script that turned this sign was deleted. You press Play. Does the sign turn?


    <b>Try:</b>

    1. Select Kiosk and find the Missing slot in its Mesh Renderer.

    2. Drag M_Kit_Painted-Metal from the asset library onto that slot.

    3. Select Sign and read the warning on its Missing script.


    <size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Shaders topic, Fix-The-Pink (a magenta shader, a different cause)</color></size>'
