  m_text: "An instance can change a value of its prefab. That change is an override: the Inspector shows it in bold, with a blue line beside it. An override wins over the prefab. The Overrides menu applies it to the prefab or reverts it.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> Bench B has an override: an orange seat. You give the Bench prefab's seat a steel material. Which benches change?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Select Bench B and open Overrides at the top of the Inspector.\n2. Revert the override: B follows the prefab again.\n3. Move a leg on Bench C, then use Overrides \u203A Apply All.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: 4 \xB7 Prefab and instance (this scene)</color></size>"
