  m_text: "A lamp post made once and placed many times. You build it as a prefab, place five instances, and make one variant: a broken lamp. Then you change the original and check that the whole family follows.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> After you make the broken variant, you make the original lamp taller. Does the broken lamp get taller too?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Build: a lamp post from cubes and cylinders, 4\u20135 m tall, with a Spot Light in its head; save it as a prefab in Assets/My-Kit.\n2. Place: five instances along the path; make the variant Lamp Post - Broken (light off, head tilted).\n3. Check: change the original prefab and watch all six lamps.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Meshes topic, Liminal-Kit 3 \xB7 Columns and furniture (Lamp post)</color></size>"
